{"3412340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Two Robots: Unleashed", "steam_appid": 3412340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Two Robots: Unleashed is a <strong>competitive card battler</strong> where strategy meets spectacle.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Rennova, a fractured sci-fi universe, you collect robot parts, build your fighter from the ground up, and take it into 1v1 card arenas designed for <strong>high-skill</strong> play and big moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/eae02994940e18ae12a8b6f6b3d0f569.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUIT UP AND EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rennova is alive and waiting. Find other Operators, explore the ship, and take on quests that build your arsenal and deepen your connection to the world. Every corner of Rennova has something to offer and every Operator you meet could become your greatest ally or your next opponent. The journey starts here. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/f443a2368c1ad2ce67694d16e61b7250.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your connection to the MARBL and make your mark across all 6 factions. Cards are your weapons. Build a deck that combos, counters, and surprises. Discover powerful synergies and construct a game plan that wins your way, not the pay-to-win way. Every faction plays differently. Every deck tells a story. What's yours?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/5de0225534e109e3aae703b4cf75d142.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAWL YOUR ROBOTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon powerful Biobots or build your own from scratch. Mix and match parts to create a fighter that fits your playstyle, whether that's an aggressive brawler, a calculated control machine, or something no one has ever seen before. The battlefield belongs to whoever brings the most creativity. Infinite combinations. Infinite possibilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/7596c47a3172833c9f6ec1dcf2927195.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE AND GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards, connections, and clout. Trade with other Operators, climb the social hierarchy, and work your way up to owning a piece of the Ownership itself. In Rennova, your reputation is your currency. Spend it wisely.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/02997911d3aa2826f4eea2a1e486755f.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=561 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS, BUILT WITH YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core card battler is here and ready to fight. We are expanding Rennova alongside our community through bug hunts, new decks and robot parts, paid tournaments, and uncovering the rusted wastelands that lie beyond. This world grows with your feedback. Come build it with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/ae1282ed0277847cebeebf9376a2fabc.poster.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1170 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/ae1282ed0277847cebeebf9376a2fabc.webm?t=1787750223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/ae1282ed0277847cebeebf9376a2fabc.mp4?t=1787750223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/5ad5dc08145a6e693fa79746680d6736.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Two Robots: Unleashed is a <strong>competitive card battler</strong> where strategy meets spectacle.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Rennova, a fractured sci-fi universe, you collect robot parts, build your fighter from the ground up, and take it into 1v1 card arenas designed for <strong>high-skill</strong> play and big moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/eae02994940e18ae12a8b6f6b3d0f569.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUIT UP AND EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rennova is alive and waiting. Find other Operators, explore the ship, and take on quests that build your arsenal and deepen your connection to the world. Every corner of Rennova has something to offer and every Operator you meet could become your greatest ally or your next opponent. The journey starts here. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/f443a2368c1ad2ce67694d16e61b7250.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your connection to the MARBL and make your mark across all 6 factions. Cards are your weapons. Build a deck that combos, counters, and surprises. Discover powerful synergies and construct a game plan that wins your way, not the pay-to-win way. Every faction plays differently. Every deck tells a story. What's yours?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/5de0225534e109e3aae703b4cf75d142.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAWL YOUR ROBOTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon powerful Biobots or build your own from scratch. Mix and match parts to create a fighter that fits your playstyle, whether that's an aggressive brawler, a calculated control machine, or something no one has ever seen before. The battlefield belongs to whoever brings the most creativity. Infinite combinations. Infinite possibilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/7596c47a3172833c9f6ec1dcf2927195.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE AND GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards, connections, and clout. Trade with other Operators, climb the social hierarchy, and work your way up to owning a piece of the Ownership itself. In Rennova, your reputation is your currency. Spend it wisely.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/02997911d3aa2826f4eea2a1e486755f.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=561 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS, BUILT WITH YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core card battler is here and ready to fight. We are expanding Rennova alongside our community through bug hunts, new decks and robot parts, paid tournaments, and uncovering the rusted wastelands that lie beyond. This world grows with your feedback. Come build it with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/ae1282ed0277847cebeebf9376a2fabc.poster.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1170 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/ae1282ed0277847cebeebf9376a2fabc.webm?t=1787750223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/ae1282ed0277847cebeebf9376a2fabc.mp4?t=1787750223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/5ad5dc08145a6e693fa79746680d6736.avif?t=1787750223\" width=1300 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A competitive eSports card battler set in a sci-fi open world. Build custom robots, craft your deck, and brawl in 1v1 arenas. Meet and socialize with other operators in orbit or in battle!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/7ead9903ddf76e0bfe8570c7145012cc74dbf3fd/header.jpg?t=1787750223", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/edb034434ed18dca3cfbcefef3e9290b7b9e981d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787750223", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/edb034434ed18dca3cfbcefef3e9290b7b9e981d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787750223", "website": "https://tworobots.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 460 (or integrated equivalent with Vulkan support)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 64 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs smoothly on most modern laptops and entry-level gaming PCs thanks to Godot 4.5 optimization.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> High refresh rates and cinematic effects scale up on stronger hardware, but not required for competitive play.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Two Robots Studios"], "publishers": ["Two Robots Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 13, "description": "Captions available"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st